# ManasAI

AI-powered emotional and mental health detection prototype. Upload a voice
recording and the app analyzes speech emotion using MFCC features and a
TensorFlow/Keras emotion-classification model.

ManasAI is an awareness and emotion-analysis prototype, not a medical
diagnosis or a substitute for professional mental-health care.
